{
  "id": "diagram-render",
  "name": "diagram-render",
  "description": "Dedicated professional-figure workflow: renders a structured diagram SPEC (layered architecture boxes/arrows, or line trajectories) into publication-quality PNG + PDF via the runtime's in-process write_chart node (write_pdf trust class — no shell, no approval prompt). The LLM authors only the spec (data), never code. Missing matplotlib / bad spec / render crash degrade honestly to rendered:false + #FALLBACK warning so callers keep a text fallback. Figures are registered as durable run artifacts.",
